{
  "openapi": "3.0.0",
  "info": {
    "title": "PoYo AI - ElevenLabs Music API",
    "description": "ElevenLabs Music API 根据文本描述或结构化作曲计划生成音乐。文本请求可设置 3 到 600 秒的时长，或请求纯音乐输出；作曲计划的每个段落为 3 到 120 秒。",
    "version": "1.0.0"
  },
  "servers": [
    {
      "url": "https://api.poyo.ai",
      "description": "生产环境"
    }
  ],
  "security": [
    {
      "BearerAuth": []
    }
  ],
  "paths": {
    "/api/generate/submit": {
      "post": {
        "summary": "提交 ElevenLabs Music 任务",
        "description": "根据文本或结构化作曲计划生成音乐。",
        "operationId": "submitElevenLabsMusicTask",
        "tags": [
          "ElevenLabs Music"
        ],
        "requestBody": {
          "required": true,
          "content": {
            "application/json": {
              "schema": {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SubmitRequest"
              },
              "examples": {
                "text-instrumental-score": {
                  "summary": "文本生成纯音乐配乐",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "elevenlabs-music",
                    "callback_url": "https://your-domain.com/callback",
                    "input": {
                      "text": "A polished instrumental cinematic game menu loop for a neon sci-fi strategy game, elegant synth arpeggios, warm analog pads, restrained percussion, gradual heroic lift, no vocals, seamless background score.",
                      "duration": 45,
                      "is_instrumental": true,
                      "output_format": "opus_48000_128"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "text-vocal-multilingual-song": {
                  "summary": "文本生成多语言人声歌曲",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "elevenlabs-music",
                    "callback_url": "https://your-domain.com/callback",
                    "input": {
                      "text": "A studio-grade upbeat pop song with a clear vocal hook for a travel campaign, bright drums, warm bass, polished lead vocal, and a short bilingual English and Spanish refrain: 'We chase the sunrise' and 'Vamos hacia la luz'.",
                      "duration": 30,
                      "output_format": "mp3_44100_128"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "composition-plan-structured-song": {
                  "summary": "作曲计划生成结构化歌曲",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "elevenlabs-music",
                    "callback_url": "https://your-domain.com/callback",
                    "input": {
                      "composition_plan": {
                        "positive_global_styles": [
                          "studio-grade pop production",
                          "clear multilingual vocal hook",
                          "cinematic electronic texture"
                        ],
                        "negative_global_styles": [
                          "muddy mix",
                          "harsh distortion",
                          "off-key vocals"
                        ],
                        "sections": [
                          {
                            "section_name": "Intro",
                            "positive_local_styles": [
                              "soft piano motif",
                              "wide atmospheric pads"
                            ],
                            "negative_local_styles": [
                              "heavy drums"
                            ],
                            "duration": 20,
                            "lines": [
                              "City lights awaken softly"
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "section_name": "Verse",
                            "positive_local_styles": [
                              "gentle vocal lead",
                              "subtle electronic pulse"
                            ],
                            "negative_local_styles": [
                              "crowded arrangement"
                            ],
                            "duration": 25,
                            "lines": [
                              "We cross the night with open eyes",
                              "Cada paso brilla bajo el cielo"
                            ]
                          },
                          {
                            "section_name": "Chorus",
                            "positive_local_styles": [
                              "anthemic hook",
                              "wide drums",
                              "bright layered vocals"
                            ],
                            "negative_local_styles": [
                              "thin bass"
                            ],
                            "duration": 30,
                            "lines": [
                              "Raise the signal, let it shine",
                              "We are the echo in the skyline"
                            ]
                          }
                        ]
                      },
                      "respect_sections_durations": true,
                      "output_format": "mp3_44100_128"
                    }
                  }
                },
                "short-brand-sonic-logo-format": {
                  "summary": "短品牌声音标识格式",
                  "value": {
                    "model": "elevenlabs-music",
                    "callback_url": "https://your-domain.com/callback",
                    "input": {
                      "text": "A concise instrumental sonic logo for a premium productivity app, five-note memorable motif, clean mallet attack, soft synth shimmer, confident but friendly ending, no vocals.",
                      "duration": 10,
                      "is_instrumental": true,
                      "output_format": "ulaw_8000"
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          }
        },
        "responses": {
          "200": {
            "description": "任务提交成功",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/SubmitResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "400": {
            "description": "请求参数无效",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          "401": {
            "description": "未授权",
            "content": {
              "application/json": {
                "schema": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/ErrorResponse"
                }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "securitySchemes": {
      "BearerAuth": {
        "type": "http",
        "scheme": "bearer",
        "bearerFormat": "API Key",
        "description": "所有 API 接口都需要 Bearer Token 认证。\n\n创建 API Key：登录 PoYo，进入 **仪表盘 → API 密钥**（[poyo.ai/zh/dashboard/api-key](https://poyo.ai/zh/dashboard/api-key)），点击创建 Key。\n\n在请求头中添加：\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR_API_KEY\n```"
      }
    },
    "schemas": {
      "SubmitRequest": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "model",
          "input"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "model": {
            "type": "string",
            "description": "模型标识符。",
            "enum": [
              "elevenlabs-music"
            ],
            "example": "elevenlabs-music"
          },
          "callback_url": {
            "type": "string",
            "format": "uri",
            "description": "接收结果通知的 Webhook 回调 URL",
            "example": "https://your-domain.com/callback"
          },
          "input": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Input",
            "description": "输入参数。text 和 composition_plan 必须且只能提供其一。"
          }
        }
      },
      "Input": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "text": {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 4100,
            "description": "描述要生成的音乐的文本。未提供 composition_plan 时必填。不要同时发送 text 和 composition_plan。",
            "example": "A polished instrumental cinematic game menu loop for a neon sci-fi strategy game, elegant synth arpeggios, warm analog pads, restrained percussion, gradual heroic lift, no vocals, seamless background score."
          },
          "composition_plan": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CompositionPlan",
            "description": "结构化作曲计划。未提供 text 时必填。不要同时发送 text 和 composition_plan。"
          },
          "duration": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 3,
            "maximum": 600,
            "description": "可选的歌曲时长（秒）。仅与 text 一起使用时有效。",
            "example": 45
          },
          "is_instrumental": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "为 true 时，请求纯音乐输出。仅与 text 一起使用时有效。",
            "default": false,
            "example": true
          },
          "respect_sections_durations": {
            "type": "boolean",
            "description": "控制段落时长的执行严格程度。仅与 composition_plan 一起使用时有效。",
            "default": true,
            "example": true
          },
          "output_format": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/OutputFormat"
          }
        }
      },
      "CompositionPlan": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "positive_global_styles",
          "negative_global_styles",
          "sections"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "positive_global_styles": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "要包含的全局风格。",
            "example": [
              "studio-grade pop production",
              "clear multilingual vocal hook",
              "cinematic electronic texture"
            ]
          },
          "negative_global_styles": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "要避免的全局风格。",
            "example": [
              "muddy mix",
              "harsh distortion",
              "off-key vocals"
            ]
          },
          "sections": {
            "type": "array",
            "minItems": 1,
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CompositionSection"
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "CompositionSection": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "section_name",
          "positive_local_styles",
          "negative_local_styles",
          "duration",
          "lines"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "section_name": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 100,
            "description": "段落名称。",
            "example": "Verse"
          },
          "positive_local_styles": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "该段落要包含的风格。",
            "example": [
              "gentle vocal lead",
              "subtle electronic pulse"
            ]
          },
          "negative_local_styles": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "description": "该段落要避免的风格。",
            "example": [
              "crowded arrangement"
            ]
          },
          "duration": {
            "type": "number",
            "minimum": 3,
            "maximum": 120,
            "description": "段落时长（秒）。",
            "example": 25
          },
          "lines": {
            "type": "array",
            "items": {
              "type": "string",
              "maxLength": 200
            },
            "description": "该段落的歌词行。",
            "example": [
              "We cross the night with open eyes",
              "Cada paso brilla bajo el cielo"
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "OutputFormat": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "输出音频格式。格式为 codec_sample_rate_bitrate。",
        "enum": [
          "mp3_22050_32",
          "mp3_44100_32",
          "mp3_44100_64",
          "mp3_44100_96",
          "mp3_44100_128",
          "mp3_44100_192",
          "pcm_8000",
          "pcm_16000",
          "pcm_22050",
          "pcm_24000",
          "pcm_44100",
          "pcm_48000",
          "ulaw_8000",
          "alaw_8000",
          "opus_48000_32",
          "opus_48000_64",
          "opus_48000_96",
          "opus_48000_128",
          "opus_48000_192"
        ],
        "default": "mp3_44100_128",
        "example": "mp3_44100_128"
      },
      "SubmitResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "required": [
          "code",
          "data"
        ],
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "integer",
            "example": 200,
            "enum": [200, 400, 401, 402, 403, 404, 408, 429, 500, 502, 503],
            "description": "业务状态码。`200` 表示成功，其他值都表示请求失败。请务必检查这个字段：部分参数校验错误会以 HTTP 200 返回，响应体里的 `code` 为 `400`。\n\n- `200`：成功\n- `400`：请求参数无效\n- `401`：API Key 缺失或无效\n- `402`：积分不足\n- `403`：没有权限\n- `404`：资源不存在\n- `408`：请求超时\n- `429`：请求频率超限\n- `500`：服务器内部错误\n- `502`：上游服务错误\n- `503`：服务暂不可用\n\n详见[错误码](/zh/api-manual/error-codes)。"
          },
          "data": {
            "type": "object",
            "required": [
              "task_id",
              "status",
              "created_time"
            ],
            "properties": {
              "task_id": {
                "type": "string",
                "example": "task_xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx"
              },
              "status": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": ["not_started", "running", "finished", "failed"],
                "example": "not_started",
                "description": "任务状态。提交后立即返回时始终为 `not_started`。后续状态请通过[查询任务状态](/zh/api-manual/task-management/status)接口或 `callback_url` 获取。\n\n- `not_started`：排队中，等待处理\n- `running`：生成中\n- `finished`：已完成，结果在 `files` 或 `output` 中\n- `failed`：失败，详情见 `error_message`"
              },
              "created_time": {
                "type": "string",
                "format": "date-time",
                "example": "2026-06-26T10:30:00"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "ErrorResponse": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [200, 400, 401, 402, 403, 404, 408, 429, 500, 502, 503],
            "description": "业务状态码。`200` 表示成功，其他值都表示请求失败。请务必检查这个字段：部分参数校验错误会以 HTTP 200 返回，响应体里的 `code` 为 `400`。\n\n- `200`：成功\n- `400`：请求参数无效\n- `401`：API Key 缺失或无效\n- `402`：积分不足\n- `403`：没有权限\n- `404`：资源不存在\n- `408`：请求超时\n- `429`：请求频率超限\n- `500`：服务器内部错误\n- `502`：上游服务错误\n- `503`：服务暂不可用\n\n详见[错误码](/zh/api-manual/error-codes)。"
          },
          "error": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "message": {
                "type": "string"
              },
              "type": {
                "type": "string"
              }
            }
          }
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
